+          "*trabajaban* + *construyendo*: they worked building railways"
+        ]
+      ]
     },
     {
       "type": "examples",
+      "title": "In context",
       "items": [
         {
-          "spanish": "Gobiernos liberales por toda la región fueron construyendo ferrocarriles, considerándolos el símbolo más visible del progreso material.",
-          "english": "Liberal governments across the region kept building railroads, considering them the most visible symbol of material progress."
