   "sections": [
     {
       "type": "text",
-      "content": "A balanced historical evaluation needs a formal frame that holds both sides of the argument at once: *por un lado* / *por otro lado* sets up the contrast, *sin embargo* turns from gains to problems, and *en definitiva* closes with a considered final judgment rather than a simple verdict. These sentences are taken directly from the previous reading."
