+          "english": "First, the countries sold coffee and meat."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "Por otro lado, sin embargo, conviene no idealizar excesivamente este periodo.",
-          "english": "On the other hand, however, it's worth not idealizing this period excessively."
+          "spanish": "Además, compraban productos de Europa.",
+          "english": "Also, they bought products from Europe."
