         },
         {
-          "spanish": "Era esencial, para el nuevo Estado mexicano, que ese pasado prehispánico se convirtiera en fuente de orgullo nacional.",
-          "english": "It was essential, for the new Mexican state, for that pre-Hispanic past to become a source of national pride."
+          "spanish": "Es necesario que el país explique bien su pasado.",
+          "english": "It is necessary that the country explains its past well."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "No era extraño que el pasado indígena fuera glorificado al mismo tiempo que el presente indígena era ignorado.",
-          "english": "It wasn't strange that the indigenous past was glorified at the same time the indigenous present was ignored."
+          "spanish": "Es injusto que se olvide a las comunidades indígenas.",
+          "english": "It is unfair that the indigenous communities are forgotten."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "Convenía a las élites que el pasado prehispánico se percibiera como una civilización gloriosa pero clausurada.",
-          "english": "It suited the elites for the pre-Hispanic past to be perceived as a glorious but closed-off civilization."
