-      "content": "Compare *era necesario que reconociera* (subjunctive, because the main clause judges the fact) with the plain statement *la población reconoció esos símbolos* (indicative, just reporting what happened). The judgment word in the main clause — *necesario*, *esencial*, *extraño*, *convenía* — is what triggers the subjunctive that follows."
+      "content": "After *es importante / necesario / injusto que* use the present subjunctive (*estudie*, *explique*, *olvide*), not the indicative. A plain fact keeps the indicative: *Los símbolos dan orgullo*. In this unit the judgments are present-day opinions that historians give, so we use the present tense."
     }
   ]
